OpenWings patch 0028: Axon, the default look, and OpenWings 1.0.4

Axon (theme keys ow-axon and ow-axon-night) is the default look: warm grey
page, white surfaces, 1px lines, square corners, extra bold condensed titles,
Inter and JetBrains Mono, one signal orange for marks. Its stylesheet and
fonts live in wings/brand/ (looks/axon.css, fonts/, licences beside them);
this patch makes it the default and lists it in the theme picker. Lichen,
Duet and Hush stay available.

  * static/js/theme.js: Axon and Axon night in THEMES and first in the
    picker (Axon, Axon night, Lichen, Duet, Duet night, Hush, Hush night).
    With nothing saved the app starts in Axon, or Axon night when the
    operating system is set to dark. Only an explicit pick saves a theme,
    so people who chose a look keep it; everyone else moves to Axon.
  * static/index.html, static/login.html: the boot scripts name the same
    default before the first paint (and the dark toolbar colour in dark);
    the theme colour and static/manifest.json use Axon's page colour
    #F2F2F0. The sign-in page's tab title reads "Sign in · OpenWings",
    and on phones "Remember me" stays under the password (the phone
    reordering left it above the username, in every look).
  * static/index.html: the Memory window's line reads "Long-term facts the
    AI remembers across chats. Recall, edit or curate them here." (no dash).
  * routes/search/search_routes.py: the web search results page defaults
    to Axon the same way.
  * Every page that links the looks asks for them with the new token
    owlooks5 (index.html, login.html, search and sign-in result pages), and
    static/sw.js has a new CACHE_NAME, so browsers fetch the new files.
  * src/theme_palette.py, src/ai_interaction.py, src/agent_loop.py,
    src/tool_schemas.py: ow-axon and ow-axon-night are known presets, Axon
    is the default the model is told about, and set_theme takes the
    picker's names (Axon, Axon night).
  * src/constants.py: the version people see (sign-in page, Settings) is
    1.0.4.

Applies to: odysseus-dev/odysseus@9d0d3720f4ca181d87bef94da826d730acc6d483
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (same as upstream)

